* DEV.* inherits the developer image's app-user authority records.
DEFINE QLOCAL('DEV.ORDERS') DEFPSIST(YES) REPLACE
DEFINE QLOCAL('DEV.PAYMENTS') DEFPSIST(YES) REPLACE
DEFINE QLOCAL('DEV.NOTIFICATIONS') DEFPSIST(YES) REPLACE
DEFINE QLOCAL('DEV.EMPTY') DEFPSIST(YES) REPLACE
* Read-only PCF discovery; the app account cannot issue administration changes.
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('SYSTEM.ADMIN.COMMAND.QUEUE') OBJTYPE(QUEUE) +
    PRINCIPAL('app') AUTHADD(PUT,INQ)
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('DEV.**') OBJTYPE(QUEUE) +
    PRINCIPAL('app') AUTHADD(DSP)
SET AUTHREC OBJTYPE(QMGR) PRINCIPAL('app') AUTHADD(DSP)
